
== 1. Inputs ===================================================
  46_line_level_data.csv: 741 lines, 17 columns

  strata relevant to the Skin confusion:
    Melanoma (non-uveal)       39 lines
    Uveal melanoma              0 lines
    Skin (non-melanoma)         2 lines

  Script 46 reported a 'Skin' lineage of n = 40. That pooled the two
  groups above. Script 45's n = 3 referred to non-melanoma skin only.

== 2. Specificity, signed ======================================
  condition: core rho < 0 AND core is the MOST NEGATIVE of the three sets

  RASSF9:
    core     n =  741  rho = -0.383  p = 2.34e-27
    shore    n =  741  rho = +0.520  p = 1.37e-52
    distal   n =  741  rho = +0.291  p = 6.86e-16
    core is the most negative set: TRUE
    -> opposite signs across the island boundary: the shore inversion,
       as in TCGA (core negative, shore positive). Confirmatory.

  RASSF10:
    core     n =  741  rho = -0.562  p = 5.44e-63
    shore    n =  741  rho = -0.418  p = 1.22e-32
    distal   n =  741  rho = +0.157  p = 1.76e-05
    core is the most negative set: TRUE
    -> shore runs in the same direction as the core, so this locus
       does not show the island-shore inversion.


