== 5. Melanoma lines only ======================================
  melanoma lines with methylation and expression: 39

  RASSF9 expression in these lines, log2(TPM + 1):
    min 0.0000 | Q1 0.0079 | median 0.0173 | Q3 0.0957 | p90 0.1940 | max 0.8795
    at or above TPM 1: 0 of 39 (0.0%)
    exactly zero: 6 | distinct values: 34

  EVERY value below the TPM = 1 line is beneath the threshold scripts
  42 and 43 used to declare expression untestable. Any correlation here
  is a correlation among sub-threshold values.

  RASSF9 core vs RASSF9 expression: rho = -0.585
    permutation p (one-sided, 20000 permutations) = 5e-05
    null distribution: mean +0.000, 5th pct -0.265

  Control genes -- RASSF9 core methylation vs each gene's expression
  in the same melanoma lines. These should NOT be strongly negative.
