    RASSF4       39   -0.276     0.0452     1.783    87.2%

== 6. Verdict, melanoma-only question ==========================
  SUGGESTIVE    rho < 0, permutation p < 0.05, and no control gene
                reaches a similar negative correlation
  UNINFORMATIVE otherwise

  VERDICT: SUGGESTIVE
    direction negative        : TRUE
    permutation p < 0.05      : TRUE (p = 5e-05)
    no control gene as strong : TRUE (most negative control rho -0.276)

  Either way this is NOT a demonstration of a methylation-expression
  relationship within melanoma cells. The expression values are all
  below the detection threshold. At best it hints that the pan-cancer
  relationship persists below that floor; at worst it is tie-structure
  noise. It belongs in a supplementary note, not a main claim.

